<p><a href="wp-content/uploads/2011/04/kamae-miller_1-mc.gif"><img class="aligncenter size-medium wp-image-781" title="kamae miller_1 mc" src="wp-content/uploads/2011/04/kamae-miller_1-mc-212x300.gif" alt="" width="212" height="300" /></a></p>
	
				       				
																					
